//-
  Main layout (signed-in pages; also used by error.pug for anonymous visitors).
  Blocks: `content` (page body, rendered below the flash messages),
          `styles` (extra <link rel="stylesheet"> tags in <head>),
          `scripts` (extra script(src=…) tags after Bootstrap and app.js; no inline JS).
  Locals: title, appName, currentUser, isAdmin, currentPath, csrfToken, messages.
  The navbar is shown only when `currentUser` is set.

  Page templates (`extends layout`, or `extends ../layout` from a sub-folder):
  - Only named blocks, mixin definitions and includes of mixin-only files may appear at the
    top level; put page code (`- var rows = …`) inside `block content`.
  - Do not declare variables named like a layout or mixin local (currentPath, currentUser,
    isAdmin, appName, title, messages, csrfToken, values, errors, fmt, statusMeta, scopes):
    e.g. a page-level `const currentPath` breaks the navbar, which renders before the content.
doctype html
include mixins/forms
include mixins/ui
include mixins/layout
html(lang='en' data-bs-theme='light')
  head
    include partials/head
    block styles
  body.d-flex.flex-column.min-vh-100
    a.skip-link.btn.btn-primary.visually-hidden-focusable(href='#main-content') Skip to main content
    if currentUser
      include partials/navbar
    main#main-content.flex-grow-1.py-4(tabindex='-1')
      .container
        include partials/flash
        block content
    include partials/footer
    include partials/scripts
    block scripts
